Research Questions

How can anomaly detection improve fraud classification?

Can hybrid feature selection improve model robustness?

Objectives

Develop a hybrid fraud detection model

Reduce false positives

Improve recall on fraud class

4. PROPOSED METHODOLOGY
4.1 Proposed Algorithm: HFS-XGBoost-AE

Steps:

Data preprocessing and normalization

Hybrid feature selection using Mutual Information and correlation filtering

Autoencoder training on non-fraud data

Reconstruction error computation (anomaly score)

Feature fusion

XGBoost classification

Model evaluation

